stroke-linejoin=\"round\" x=\"93.78\" y=\"558.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Système de partage</text><text class=\"pele-cluster-label\" fill=\"var(--_m)\" x=\"93.78\" y=\"558.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Système de partage</text></g><g class=\"pele-cluster-title\" data-id=\"subGraph1\"><text fill=\"none\" stroke=\"color-mix(in srgb,var(--_a) 50%,var(--_bg))\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" x=\"258.94\" y=\"344.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mon second cerveau</text><text class=\"pele-cluster-label\" fill=\"var(--_m)\" x=\"258.94\" y=\"344.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mon second cerveau</text></g></g><g class=\"pele-nodes\"><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"Content\" transform=\"translate(270.48,91.5)\"><rect x=\"-101.33\" y=\"-43.5\" width=\"202.66\" height=\"87\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" text-anchor=\"middle\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"-15.4\">Articles, Livres, Vidéos,</tspan><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\">Podcasts, Newsletters,</tspan><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"26.6\">Tweets</tspan></text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"Readwise\" transform=\"translate(270.48,207)\"><rect x=\"-53.12\" y=\"-24\" width=\"106.24\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Readwise</text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"Obsidian\" transform=\"translate(270.48,412)\"><rect x=\"-79.79\" y=\"-33\" width=\"159.58\" height=\"66\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" text-anchor=\"middle\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"-4.9\">Obsidian (fichiers</tspan><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"16.1\">markdown)</tspan></text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"Next.js\" transform=\"translate(107.8,617)\"><rect x=\"-66.9\" y=\"-24\" width=\"133.79\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">johackim.com</text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"Newsletter\" transform=\"translate(270.48,617)\"><rect x=\"-55.78\" y=\"-24\" width=\"111.57\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Newsletter</text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"Twitter\" transform=\"translate(452.51,617)\"><rect x=\"-86.25\" y=\"-24\" width=\"172.5\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Twitter + Mastodon</text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"SEO\" transform=\"translate(107.8,722)\"><rect x=\"-79.8\" y=\"-33\" width=\"159.6\" height=\"66\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" text-anchor=\"middle\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"-4.9\">SEO (Moteurs de</tspan><tspan x=\"0\" y=\"16.1\">recherche)</tspan></text></g></g></svg></div>\n\n## Mon système de capture d'informations\n\nC'est à cet endroit que je capture toutes les informations (RSS, Newsletters, Tweets, Vidéos YouTube, etc...).\n\nJe ne consulte mon actualité qu'une fois par jour à l'aide de **[Readwise](https://read.readwise.io)** qui rassemble tous les blogs, les podcasts, les chaines YouTube et les newsletter que je suis.\n\n## Mon second cerveau\n\nC'est à cet endroit que je crée et sauvegarde toutes les informations qui me semblent pertinentes.\n\nIl s'agit d'un ensemble de fichiers texte bruts au format **markdown** reliés entre eux par des `[[liens bidirectionnels]]`.\n\nCes fichiers peuvent être consultés avec n'importe quel éditeur de texte.\n\n<p>Personnellement, j'utilise <a href=\"/neovim\" title=\"Neovim\">Neovim</a> et <a href=\"/obsidian\" title=\"Obsidian\">Obsidian</a>.</p>\n\n\nL'ensemble est versionné avec [git](https://github.com/git/git) et sauvegardé chaque jour sur un serveur externe.\n\n## Mon système de partage\n\n**J'automatise chaque semaine le partage de mon second cerveau.**\n\nToutes mes notes sont publiées sur mon blog avec [Next.js, Obsidian Publish et IPFS](https://github.com/johackim/johackim.com).\n\nUn récapitulatif est envoyé chaque mois sur [ma newsletter](https://johackim.com/newsletter).\n","isIndex":false,"url":"https://johackim.com/mon-second-cerveau","mocs":[{"emoji":"💻","title":"Programmation","permalink":"programmation"},{"emoji":"🧠","title":"Psychologie","permalink":"psychologie"},{"emoji":"🎒","title":"Indie hacker","permalink":"indie-hacker"},{"emoji":"🔮","title":"Obsidian","permalink":"obsidian"},{"emoji":"🐧","title":"Linux","permalink":"linux"},{"emoji":"🐳","title":"Docker","permalink":"docker"},{"emoji":"⚡️","title":"Productivité","permalink":"productivite"},{"emoji":"🥷","title":"Cybersécurité","permalink":"cybersecurite"},{"emoji":"🛡️","title":"Vie privée","permalink":"vie-privee"},{"emoji":"📚","title":"Livres","permalink":"livres"},{"emoji":"🗺️","title":"Modèles mentaux","permalink":"modeles-mentaux"}],"graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"202104091703","title":"Hacker indépendant","href":"/","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"202104161250","title":"Mon second cerveau","href":"/mon-second-cerveau","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"202105111505","title":"A propos de moi","href":"/a-propos","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"202106272129","title":"Mon processus de prise de notes","href":"/mon-processus-de-prise-de-notes","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Digital Garden","title":"Digital Garden","href":"/digital-garden","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Neovim","title":"Neovim : la version améliorée et allégée de vim","href":"/neovim","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Obsidian","title":"Obsidian","href":"/obsidian","isUnresolved":false}],"links":[{"source":"202104091703","target":"202104161250"},{"source":"202104091703","target":"Obsidian"},{"source":"202104091703","target":"202105111505"},{"source":"202104161250","target":"Digital Garden"},{"source":"202104161250","target":"Neovim"},{"source":"202104161250","target":"Obsidian"},{"source":"202105111505","target":"202104161250"},{"source":"202106272129","target":"Obsidian"},{"source":"202106272129","target":"202104161250"}],"activeId":"202104161250"},"file":"202104161250.md","fileName":"202104161250","title":"Mon second cerveau","description":"Découvrez comment j'ai créé un \"second cerveau\" pour expérimenter, recenser et partager toutes mes idées.","comments":true,"permalink":"mon-second-cerveau","datePublished":"2021-04-16T10:50","dateUpdated":"2024-04-13T01:52:00","aliases":"[Mon second cerveau]","publish":true,"rss":true},"__N_SSG":true}